  "notes": "みんな means \"everyone\" or \"all.\" A casual, everyday word.\n\nPOLITENESS SCALE:\n- みんな: casual/informal\n- ⟦{皆|みな}さん→皆さん：02971_minasan⟧: polite\n- ⟦{皆様|みなさま}→皆様：15860_minasama⟧: very polite/formal/honorific\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- みんな⟦で→で：00502_de⟧: all together, with everyone\n- みんな⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧: to everyone\n- みんな⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧: everyone (subject)\n- みんな⟦の→の：09472_no⟧: everyone's\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- みんな⟦で→で：00502_de⟧⟦{行|い}こう→行く：00119_iku⟧: Let's all go together\n- みんな⟦{知|し}って→知る：00458_shiru⟧⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧: Everyone knows\n- みんな⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{伝|つた}える→伝える：01220_tsutaeru⟧: to tell everyone\n- みんな⟦で→で：00502_de⟧⟦{協力|きょうりょく}する→協力する：25370_kyouryokusuru⟧: to cooperate together\n\nWRITING:\nCan also be written as {皆|みんな} with kanji, though hiragana is more common in casual writing.",
